                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is TWT's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Radical transparency positioning + founder-led content that amplifies category-education. Category incumbents can't easily match without product changes.</p>
                                        <h3>Is transparency marketing sustainable long-term?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes if product truth stays consistent. Loses power if brand ever compromises stated principles.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new F&amp;B brands adopt this playbook?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes with founder commitment + product decisions to support the positioning. Requires willingness to have public opinions.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does TWT spend on marketing?</h3>
                                        <p>Comparatively less than aggressive D2C peers — content + founder presence + community drive discovery. Reduces paid dependence.</p>
